<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Bib Sen An</book>
  <para style="h">1 Korentyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">I KORENTYEN YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Korentyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Kor</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 KORENTYEN YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Paul, aple kon apot Jésus Kri pa volonte Bondye a, ak Sosthène, frè nou, <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>A legliz Bondye ki nan vil Corinthe lan, a sila ki gen tan sanktifye nan Jésus Kri yo, sen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>pa apèl Bondye yo, avèk tout sila yo nan tout kote ki rele non Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri; Senyè pa yo e pa nou. <verse eid="1CO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>Gras de nou e lapè Bondye, Papa nou an, ak Senyè a Jésus Kri.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen remèsye Bondye mwen an tout tan, o sijè de nou menm, pou lagras Bondye te bannou nan Jésus Kri a. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Ke nan tout bagay nou te anrichi nan Li, nan tout pawòl ak tout konesans, <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>menm pandan temwayaj konsènan Kris la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:14">Wo 15:14</ref></char></note>konfime nan nou, <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>jis pou nou pa manke nan okenn don, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:30">Luc 17:30</ref></char></note>tann avèk enpasyans revelasyon a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:19">Wo 8:19</ref></char></note>ki va osi konfime nou jiska lafen, san defo nan jou Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Det 7:9</ref></char></note>Bondye fidèl, selon Sila nou te rele nan amitye fratènèl avèk Fis Li a, Jésus Kri, Senyè nou an.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Koulye a, mwen egzòte nou, frè yo, pa non a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, pou nou tout vin antann nou, pou pa gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:18">I Kor 11:18</ref></char></note>divizyon pami nou, men pou nou vin konplè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:16">Wo 12:16</ref></char></note>menm panse ak nan menm jijman. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Paske mwen enfòme o sijè de nou menm, frè m yo, pa moun Chloé yo, ke gen konfli pami nou. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Alò, men kisa m ap di. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:4">I Kor 3:4</ref></char></note>Nou chak ap di: “Mwen se moun Paul”, “Mwen se moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Trav 18:24</ref></char></note>Apollos”, “Mwen se moun Céphas”, e “Mwen se moun Kris la”. <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Èske Kris la vin divize? Èske Paul te krisifye pou nou? Oswa èske nou te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mat 28:19</ref></char></note>batize nan non Paul? <verse eid="1CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Mwen remèsye Bondye ke m pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:18">Trav 18:18</ref></char></note>batize okenn nan nou sof ke Crispus ak Gaïus, <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>pou okenn moun pa ka di ke nou te batize nan non mwen. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Alò, mwen te batize tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">I Kor 16:15</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 16:17">17</ref></char></note>fanmi Stéphanas la; anplis de sa, mwen pa konnen si m te batize okenn lòt moun. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:2">Jn 4:2</ref></char></note>Paske Kris pa t voye m pou batize, men pou preche bòn nouvèl la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:1">I Kor 2:1</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 2:4">4</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 2:13">13</ref></char></note>pa avèk bèl pawòl moun save yo, pou ke kwa Kris la pa ta vin anile. <verse eid="1CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Paske pawòl lakwa a se foli pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:15">II Kor 2:15</ref></char></note>sila k ap peri yo, men pou nou menm k ap sove yo, se pwisans a Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Paske sa ekri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:14">És 29:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Mwen va detwi sajès a saj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">e entèlijans moun save yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">mwen va mete sou kote.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Kote nonm saj la? Kote skrib la? Kote moun deba a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:17">Job 12:17</ref></char></note>laj sila a? Èske Bondye pa fè sajès a mond lan vin foli? <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Paske akoz nan sajès Bondye, lemond ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:27">I Kor 1:27</ref></char></note>sajès pa li pa t vin konnen Bondye. Konsa, Bondye te byen kontan selon foli a mesaj ki te preche a, pou sove sila ki kwè yo. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Paske anverite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mat 12:18</ref></char></note>Jwif yo mande pou sign, e Grèk yo chache sajès; <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>men nou preche <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:2">I Kor 2:2</ref></char></note>Kris krisifye a, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:8">I Pi 2:8</ref></char></note>Jwif yo, yon wòch k ap fè moun bite, e pou pèp etranje yo, yon foli. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Men pou sila ki aple yo, ni Jwif, ni Grèk, Kris la se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:18">I Kor 1:18</ref></char></note>pwisans a Bondye, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:30">I Kor 1:30</ref></char></note>sajès Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Paske foli Bondye a pi saj ke lòm, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:4">II Kor 13:4</ref></char></note>feblès Bondye a pi fò ke lòm.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Paske konsidere apèl nou an, frè yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:25">Mat 11:25</ref></char></note>pa t gen anpil moun ki te saj selon lachè, ni anpil moun ki te fò, ni anpil moun nòb. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Men Bondye te chwazi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20">I Kor 1:20</ref></char></note>foli a mond lan pou fè saj yo wont, e Bondye te chwazi bagay fèb a mond lan pou fè bagay ki pwisan yo vin piti. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Konsa, Bondye chwazi bagay ki ba e meprize nan mond lan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:7">Wo 4:7</ref></char></note>bagay ki pa anyen, pou li kapab anile bagay ki egziste deja yo, <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>pou fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:9">Ef 2:9</ref></char></note>pèsòn pa kapab vante tèt yo devan Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Men selon sa ke Li menm te fè a, nou nan Jésus Kri. Se Li ki te devni pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:24">I Kor 1:24</ref></char></note>sajès ki soti nan Bondye, ansanm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Jr 23:5</ref></char></note>jistis, sanktifikasyon, ak redanmsyon. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Konsa, jan sa ekri a: “Kite sila ki vante tèt li a, vante tèt li nan SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Lè m te vin kote nou, frè m yo, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:17">I Kor 1:17</ref></char></note>pa t vini avèk yon wotè langaj oubyen sajès pou pwokame a nou temwayaj Bondye a. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Paske mwen te detèmine pou m pa konnen anyen pami nou, sof <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:23">I Kor 1:23</ref></char></note>Jésus Kri, e Sila krisifye a. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Mwen te avèk nou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:10">I Kor 4:10</ref></char></note>feblès, laperèz, ak anpil tranbleman. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Epi mesaj mwen avèk predikasyon mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:17">I Kor 1:17</ref></char></note>pa t fèt avèk pawòl sajès pou fè moun kwè, men nan demonstrasyon Lespri a ak pouvwa a, <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>pou lafwa nou pa t repoze sou sajès a lòm, men sou pouvwa Bondye a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:7">II Kor 4:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Malgre sa, nou konn pale sajès pami sila ki gen tan<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:13">Ef 4:13</ref></char></note>fin grandi. Se yon sajès ki pa sòti ni nan tan sila a, ni nan chèf a tan sila yo, k ap pase. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Men nou pale sajès Bondye nan yon mistè, sajès kache ke Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Wo 8:29</ref></char></note>planifye menm avan tan yo pou laglwa nou; <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>sajès <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:6">I Kor 2:6</ref></char></note>ke okenn nan chèf a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20">I Kor 1:20</ref></char></note>tan sila yo pa konprann. Paske si yo te konprann li, yo pa t ap krisifye Senyè laglwa a. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Men jan sa ekri a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 64:4">És 64:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Bagay ke zye pa wè e zòrèy pa tande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">ki pa janm antre nan kè a lòm;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">tout sa Bondye prepare pou sila ki renmen Li yo.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Paske a nou menm Bondye te revele yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:26">Jn 14:26</ref></char></note>pa Lespri a. Paske Lespri a toujou sonde tout bagay, menm jis nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:33">Wo 11:33</ref></char></note>pwofondè Bondye a. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Paske kilès pami lòm ki konnen panse a lòm eksepte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:27">Pwov 20:27</ref></char></note>lespri a lòm ki anndan li menm nan? Menm jan an, panse a Bondye yo; pèsòn pa konnen yo eksepte Lespri Bondye a. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Alò, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15">Wo 8:15</ref></char></note>pa resevwa, lespri mond lan, men Lespri ki sòti nan Bondye a, pou nou kapab konnen bagay ke Bondye bannou gratis yo. <verse eid="1CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Sou bagay sa yo nou pa pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:17">I Kor 1:17</ref></char></note> ak pawòl sajès de moun ki soti nan lòm, men pito ak pawòl Lespri Sen an, ki konpare bagay lespri yo ak bagay lespri yo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Men yon nonm nan eta natirèl li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:17">Jn 14:17</ref></char></note>pa aksepte bagay a Lespri Bondye yo, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:18">I Kor 1:18</ref></char></note>se foli yo ye pou li. Li pa kapab konprann yo, paske yo ka jije sèlman pa yon lespri k ap viv nan Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Men sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:1">I Kor 3:1</ref></char></note>reflechi ak yon lespri ki soti nan Bondye a, jije tout bagay, men li menm p ap jije pa okenn moun. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>“Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">És 40:3</ref></char></note>kilès ki te konnen refleksyon Senyè a, pou li ta enstwi Li?” Men se panse a Kris nou genyen.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Epi mwen, frè m yo, mwen pa t kab pale avèk nou menm tankou moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:6">I Kor 2:6</ref></char></note>plen lespri Bondye, men tankou moun lachè yo, tankou ti zanfan piti nan Kris yo. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Mwen te bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12">Eb 5:12</ref></char></note>lèt pou nou bwè olye gwo manje; paske nou potko kab resevwa l. Anverite, menm koulye a, nou poko kapab, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>pwiske nou toujou nan lachè. Paske akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:13">Wo 13:13</ref></char></note>gen jalouzi ak konfli pami nou, èske nou pa nan lachè, epi èske nou p ap mache tankou lòm natirèl? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Paske lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">I Kor 1:12</ref></char></note>youn di: “Mwen se moun Paul”, epi yon lòt: “Mwen se moun Appollos”, èske nou p ap aji kòmsi se lòm natirèl ke nou ye?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Alò, ki moun Apollos ye? E ki moun Paul ye? Se sèvitè pa sila nou te vin kwè yo, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Wo 12:6</ref></char></note>jan Senyè a te bay opòtinite a yo chak. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Mwen te plante, Appollos te awoze, men Bondye te fè l grandi. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Alò, se pa ni sila ki plante a ni sila ki awoze a ki anyen, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 15:10">I Kwo 15:10</ref></char></note>Bondye ki fè l grandi a. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Alò, sila ki plante a ak sila ki awoze a se youn; men chak moun va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:14">I Kor 3:14</ref></char></note>resevwa pwòp rekonpans li selon pwòp travay li. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Paske nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:20">Mc 16:20</ref></char></note>ouvriye parèy avèk Bondye. Nou menm se chan Bondye a, kay la ke L ap bati a.<verse eid="1CO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>gras Bondye ki te ban mwen an, kon yon mèt k ap bati byen saj, mwen te poze yon fondasyon. Men konsa, se yon lòt k ap bati sou li. Konsa, fòk chak moun pridan sou jan li bati sou li a. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Paske pèsòn pa kapab poze okenn lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">És 28:16</ref></char></note>fondasyon sof ke sila ki poze deja a, ki se Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Alò, si nenpòt moun bati sou fondasyon an avèk lò, ajan, bijou presye, bwa, zèb sèch, oswa pay, <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 4:5">I Kwo 4:5</ref></char></note>zèv a chak moun va vin byen parèt. Paske lajounen va fè l vin parèt klè, akoz sa gen pou revele avèk dife. Epi dife a, li menm, va fè prèv valè zèv chak moun. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Si zèv a yon moun ki bati sou li a rete toujou, li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:8">I Kor 3:8</ref></char></note>resevwa yon rekonpans. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Si zèv a yon moun vin brile, li va soufri pèt, men li menm, li va sove <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 23:10">Job 23:10</ref></char></note>kòmsi, se pa dife.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Èske nou pa konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:9">Wo 8:9</ref></char></note>nou se tanp Bondye a, e ke Lespri Bondye a rete nan nou? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Si yon moun detwi tanp Bondye a, Bondye va detwi li, paske tanp Bondye a sen, e se sa nou ye.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Pa kite pèsòn twonpe tèt li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:2">I Kor 8:2</ref></char></note>si yon moun pami nou panse ke li saj nan tan sila a, li oblije vin fou pou li kapab vin saj.<verse eid="1CO 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Paske sajès mond sa a se foli devan Bondye. Paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Job 5:13</ref></char></note>“Se Li menm ki kenbe saj yo nan pwòp koken pa yo.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Epi ankò: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Sòm 94:11</ref></char></note>“Senyè a konnen panse a saj yo, ke yo initil.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Donk, pa kite pèsòn vante tèt li pou moun. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:32">Wo 8:32</ref></char></note>tout bagay se pou nou menm, <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">I Kor 1:12</ref></char></note>sof ke se Paul, oswa Appollos, oswa Céphas, o lemonn, o <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:38">Wo 8:38</ref></char></note>lavi, o lanmò, bagay prezan yo, oswa bagay ki gen pou vini yo; tout apatyen de nou menm. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 10:7">II Kwo 10:7</ref></char></note>nou apatyen a Kris; e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:3">I Kwo 11:3</ref></char></note>Kris apatyen a Bondye.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Kite yon moun gade nou konsa, kòm sèvitè a Kris e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:7">Tit 1:7</ref></char></note>jeran a mistè ki pou Kris yo.<verse eid="1CO 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Nan ka sila a, anplis, li nesesè pou twouve jeran yo fidèl. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Men pou mwen se yon ti bagay tou piti pou mwen ta kab jije pa nou menm, oswa nenpòt lòt tribinal moun. Anverite, mwen pa menm jije pwòp tèt mwen. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Mwen pa konsyan de anyen kont tèt mwen. Men se pa sa ki fè m inosan, men ke sila ki jije mwen an se Senyè a. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Pou sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:1">Wo 2:1</ref></char></note>pa kontinye jije avan lè, men tann <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:16">Wo 2:16</ref></char></note>jiskaske Senyè a vini pou Li kapab nan menm tan eklere nan limyè bagay ki kache nan tenèb yo, e devwale tout motif ki nan kè lèzòm. Konsa, lwanj chak moun resevwa va sòti nan Bondye.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Alò, frè m yo, mwen te sèvi tout sa konsènan mwen menm ak Apollos kòm yon egzanp pou koz a nou menm. Selon sa mwen te di, mwen vle ou konprann ke nou pa pou ale pi lwen de sa ki nan ekriti sen yo, pou okenn nan nou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">I Kor 1:12</ref></char></note>vin ògeye anvè youn e kont yon lòt. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Paske kilès ki kwè ke ou pi bon? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:27">Jn 3:27</ref></char></note>Kisa nou genyen ke nou pa t resevwa? E si Nou te resevwa li, poukisa nou vante tèt nou kòmsi nou pa t resevwa l.<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:17">Rev 3:17</ref></char></note>deja ranpli! Nou deja vin rich! Nou deja vin wa san èd nou menm! E anverite, mwen ta kontan si nou te deja wa pou nou menm ta kapab renye ansanm avèk nou. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Paske mwen panse ke Bondye te fè nou menm kòm apot pi ba ke tout; tankou moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:36">Wo 8:36</ref></char></note>kondane a lanmò, paske nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:33">Eb 10:33</ref></char></note>gen tan vin yon spektak pou mond lan, ni pou zanj yo, ni pou moun. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Nou se moun fou pou kòz a Kris la, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:18">I Kor 3:18</ref></char></note>ou menm, ou saj nan Kris; nou fèb, men ou menm, ou fò; ou menm, ou byen distenge, men nou menm, nou san onè. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Jiska moman sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:35">Wo 8:35</ref></char></note>nou grangou ak swaf, mal abiye, maltrete, e san kote pou nou rete. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Konsa, nou redi di nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Trav 18:3</ref></char></note>travay avèk pwòp men nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:13">I Pi 3:13</ref></char></note>Lè yo joure nou, nou beni yo. Lè nou pèsekite, nou sipòte sa. <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Lè yo pale nou mal, nou eseye antann nou. Nou devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 3:34">Lam 3:34</ref></char></note>tankou fatra a mond lan, retay nan tout bagay, menm jiska koulye a.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Mwen pa ekri bagay sa yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:5">I Kor 6:5</ref></char></note>fè nou wont, men pou avèti nou kòm pitit byeneme mwen. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Paske si nou te gen anpil kantite pwofesè an Kris ki pa menm kab konte, menm konsa nou pa t ap gen anpil papa. Paske nan Jésus Kris, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:12">Nonb 11:12</ref></char></note>te devni papa nou akoz bòn nouvèl la. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Konsa, mwen egzòte nou, pou nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">I Kor 11:1</ref></char></note>imitatè a mwen menm. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Se pou rezon sa a, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:10">I Kor 16:10</ref></char></note>voye bannou Timothée, ki se pitit byeneme e fidèl mwen nan Senyè a. Li va fè nou sonje chemen mwen an ki baze nan Kris, menm jan ke mwen enstwi toupatou nan tout legliz yo. <verse eid="1CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Alò, kèk nan nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:6">I Kor 4:6</ref></char></note>awogan, kòmsi mwen pa t ap vin kote nou. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Men mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:2">Trav 20:2</ref></char></note>va vini kote nou byento <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:21">Trav 18:21</ref></char></note>si Bondye vle e mwen va vin fè egzamen, pa nan pawòl a sila ki awogan yo, men nan pèz pwisans yo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Paske wayòm Bondye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:4">I Kor 2:4</ref></char></note>pa fèt avèk pawòl, men avèk pwisans. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Kisa nou dezire? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:23">II Kor 1:23</ref></char></note>Èske mwen dwe vin kote nou avèk yon baton, oswa avèk lanmou avèk lespri jantiyès?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Anverite gen rapò ke gen imoralite pami nou, yon kalite imoralite ki pa menm egziste pami pèp etranje yo; ke yon moun gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:8">Lev 18:8</ref></char></note>madanm a papa li.<verse eid="1CO 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Nou vin awogan, olye nou kriye anpil pou sila ki te fè zak sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:13">I Kor 5:13</ref></char></note>pou l ta kapab vin retire nan mitan nou.<verse eid="1CO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Paske mwen menm, bò kote pa m, malgre mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:5">Kol 2:5</ref></char></note>absan nan kò men mwen prezan nan lespri. Mwen deja jije mesye ki fè zak sila a, tankou mwen te prezan. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Nan non Senyè nou an Jésus Kri, lè nou vin rasanble, e mwen menm avèk nou nan lespri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:23">Jn 20:23</ref></char></note>avèk pouvwa Senyè nou an Jésus,<verse eid="1CO 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>nou gen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:31">Luc 22:31</ref></char></note>livre yon nonm konsa bay Satan pou detwi chè l, pou lespri li kapab sove <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">I Kor 1:8</ref></char></note>nan jou Senyè a Jésus.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 4:16">Jc 4:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vante tèt nou an pa bon. Èske nou pa konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mat 16:6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:12">12</ref></char></note>yon ti kras ledven fè tout boul pen an leve?<verse eid="1CO 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Retire vye ledven an pou nou kapab vin yon boul pat tounèf; kòmsi ke nou an reyalite deja san ledven. Paske Kris, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:12">Mc 14:12</ref></char></note>Pak pa nou an, osi te sèvi kon sakrifis nou.<verse eid="1CO 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Konsa, annou selebre fèt la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:19">Egz 12:19</ref></char></note>pa avèk vye ledven an, ni avèk move ledven an ak mechanste, men avèk pen san ledven nan plen senserite ak verite a.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Mwen te ekri nou nan lèt mwen an pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:14">II Kor 6:14</ref></char></note>pa asosye nou avèk moun imoral yo;<verse eid="1CO 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Mwen pa t vle di tout moun imoral ki nan mond sa a, ni avèk moun lemonn ki gen lanvi, ki nan fwod, oubyen moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:27">I Kor 10:27</ref></char></note>idolat yo; paske konsa nou ta dwe kite mond lan nèt.<verse eid="1CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Men an reyalite, mwen te ekri nou pou nou pa asosye nou avèk nenpòt moun ke nou konn rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:15">Trav 1:15</ref></char></note>“frè” si li se yon moun imoral, oubyen ranpli ak lanvi, oubyen yon moun idolat, yon medizan, yon tafyatè, oubyen yon moun ki nan fwod——pou nou pa ta menm manje avèk yon moun konsa.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Paske kisa mwen gen pou fè nan jije moun deyò yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:3-5">I Kwo 5:3-5</ref></char></note>Èske se pa sila anndan legliz yo pou nou jije?<verse eid="1CO 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Men sila ki deyò yo, se Bondye ki pou jije yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Det 13:5</ref></char></note>Retire sila ki malveyan an pami nou menm.<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Èske gen nan nou ke lè l gen yon ka kont vwazen li, li tante ale devan lalwa, devan moun enjis yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:17">Mat 18:17</ref></char></note>olye devan sen yo? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Oubyen èske nou pa konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dan 7:18</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:22">22</ref>,<ref loc="DAN 7:27">27</ref></char></note>se sen yo ki va jije mond lan? Si lemonn jije pa nou menm, èske nou pa konpetan pou regle ti bagay piti konsa yo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:16">Wo 6:16</ref></char></note>Èske nou pa konnen ke nou va jije zanj yo? Konbyen anplis pou afè lavi sa a? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Donk, si konsa, nou sèvi ak tribinal pou regle pwoblèm nan lavi sa, èske nou chwazi kon jij sila ki pa kab reprezante anyen nan legliz yo? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:14">I Kor 4:14</ref></char></note>Mwen di nou sa pou wont nou. Si se konsa, ke pa gen yon moun saj pami nou ki kapab deside antre frè li yo? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Men frè ale devan lalwa avèk frè, e tout sa devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:14">II Kor 6:14</ref></char></note>enkwayan yo. <verse eid="1CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Alò konsa, sa se deja yon defèt pou nou, pou n ap fè pwosè avèk youn lòt. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:39">Mat 5:39</ref></char></note>Poukisa nou pa pito soufri lenjistis? Poukisa nou pa pito aksepte sibi fwod? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Okontrè, nou menm, nou fè lenjistis ak fwod la. Nou fè sa menm kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:6">I Tes 4:6</ref></char></note>frè nou yo.<verse eid="1CO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Oubyen èske nou pa konnen ke moun enjis yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:32">Trav 20:32</ref></char></note>eritye wayòm syèl la? Pa twonpe tèt nou; ni moun imoral yo, ni moun idolat yo, ni efemine yo, ni omoseksyèl yo <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>ni vòlè yo, ni moun ki gen lanvi yo, ni tafyatè yo, ni medizan yo, ni sila ki nan fwod yo, p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:32">Trav 20:32</ref></char></note>eritye wayòm Bondye a. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Se konsa kèk nan nou te ye, men nou te vin lave, nou te vin sanktifye, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:30">Wo 8:30</ref></char></note>jistifye nan non Senyè a, Jésus Kri ak nan Lespri a Bondye nou an.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:23">I Kor 10:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout bagay pèmèt pou mwen, men se pa tout bagay ki itil. Tout bagay pèmèt, men mwen p ap kite m domine pa anyen. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>Manje se pou vant e vant se pou manje; men Bondye va mete yon fen a toulède. Men kò a se pa pou imoralite, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:15">I Kor 6:15</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 6:19">19</ref></char></note>pou Senyè a; e Senyè a se pou kò a. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Alò, Bondye non sèlman leve Senyè a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Jn 6:39</ref></char></note>va osi leve nou selon pouvwa Li. <verse eid="1CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Èske nou pa konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Wo 12:5</ref></char></note>kò nou se manb a Kris yo ye? Èske mwen dwe pran manb kò Kris yo e fè yo vin manb a yon pwostitiye? Ke sa pa janm fèt! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Oubyen èske nou pa konnen ke yon moun ki jwenn tèt li avèk yon pwostitiye vin yon sèl kò avèk li? Paske Li di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Jen 2:24</ref></char></note>“Yo de a va devni yon sèl chè”. <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Men sila a ki vin jwenn tèt li avèk Senyè a vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:21-23">Jn 17:21-23</ref></char></note>youn nan lespri avèk Li. <verse eid="1CO 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref></char></note>Kouri kite imoralite. Tout lòt peche ke yon moun fè se deyò kò a, men moun imoral la peche kont pwòp kò l. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Oubyen èske nou pa konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:21">Jn 2:21</ref></char></note>kò nou se yon tanp pou Lespri Sen an, ki soti nan Bondye, ki rete nan nou, e ke nou pa mèt pwòp tèt nou? <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Paske nou te achte a yon pri; Konsa, bay glwa a Bondye avèk kò nou.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Alò, konsènan bagay ke nou te ekri yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:8">I Kor 7:8</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:26">26</ref></char></note>li bon pou yon nonm pa touche yon fanm. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Men akoz imoralite ka fèt, chak nonm dwe gen pwòp madanm li e chak fanm dwe gen pwòp mari li. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Mari a dwe akonpli devwa li anvè madanm li, e menm jan an tou, madanm lan anvè mari li. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Madanm nan pa gen otorite sou pwòp kò li, men se pou mari a, e menm jan an mari a pa gen otorite sou pwòp kò li, men se pou madanm nan. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Sispann refize youn lòt, eksepte pa akò pou yon ti tan, pou nou kapab konsakre nou nan lapriyè, e retounen ansanm ankò pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:10">Mat 4:10</ref></char></note>Satan pa tante nou akoz mank kontwòl tèt nou.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Men sa mwen vin di kòm yon konsesyon ak nou, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:8">II Kwo 8:8</ref></char></note>pa kòm yon lòd. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Sepandan, mwen ta pito ke tout moun te menm rete tankou mwen menm. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:8">I Kor 7:8</ref></char></note>Men chak moun gen pwòp don li ki sòti nan Bondye; pou youn se yon jan, e pou yon lòt, se yon lòt jan. <verse eid="1CO 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Alò mwen di a sila ki poko marye yo, e ak vèv yo, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:1">I Kor 7:1</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:26">26</ref></char></note>li ta bon pou yo si yo rete menm jan ak mwen menm. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Men si yo pa gen kontwòl pwòp tèt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:14">I Tim 5:14</ref></char></note>kite yo marye; paske li pi bon pou marye pase pou brile avèk pasyon. <verse eid="1CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Men a sila ki marye yo, mwen bay lòd sa yo. Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:16">Mal 2:16</ref></char></note>pa mwen, men se Senyè a ki bay li, ke madanm nan pa dwe kite mari li <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Men si li kite li, li dwe rete san marye, oswa rekonsilye avèk mari li. Ni mari a pa dwe divòse avèk madanm li.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Men a lòt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:6">I Kor 7:6</ref></char></note>se mwen menm ki di l, se pa Senyè a, ke si yon frè gen yon madanm ki se yon enkwayan, e li dakò viv avèk li, fòk li pa divòse avèk li. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Epi yon fanm ki gen yon mari ki pa kwayan, e li dakò viv avèk li, li pa dwe voye mari li ale. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Paske mari enkwayan an vin sanktifye akoz madanm li, e madanm enkwayan an vin sanktifye akoz mari li ki kwayan an, paske otreman pitit nou yo te enpi, men koulye a, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:2">Esd 9:2</ref></char></note>sen. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Men si sila ki enkwayan an ale, kite l ale. Frè a oswa sè a pa mare nan ka sila yo, men Bondye rele nou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>lapè.<verse eid="1CO 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Paske kòman ou kab konnen o madanm, si ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:14">Wo 11:14</ref></char></note>sove mari ou? E kòman ou kab konnen, o mari, si ou va sove madanm ou.<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>jan Senyè a bay a chak moun nan, jan Bondye rele chak moun nan konsa, kite l mache. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">I Kor 4:17</ref></char></note>se konsa ke m bay lòd nan tout legliz yo.<verse eid="1CO 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Èske yon moun ki te rele pa Bondye te deja sikonsi? Li pa dwe vin ensikonsi. Èske yon moun lè l rele pa Bondye tou ensikonsi? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:1">Trav 15:1</ref></char></note>Li pa dwe vin sikonsi. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:27">Wo 2:27</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 2:29">29</ref></char></note>Sikonsizyon pa anyen, e ensikonsizyon pa anyen, men sa ki enpòtan an se kenbe kòmandman Bondye a. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:24">I Kor 7:24</ref></char></note>Chak moun dwe rete nan menm kondisyon ke li te resevwa apèl la. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Èske nou te resevwa apèl la pandan nou te esklav? Pa enkyete nou pou sa, men si nou kapab osi vin lib, pito nou fè l. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Paske sila ki te rele pa Senyè a pandan li te esklav la, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:16">Phm 16</ref></char></note>moun lib a Senyè a; menm jan an sila ki te rele pandan li te lib la, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:16">I Pi 2:16</ref></char></note>esklav a Kris la.<verse eid="1CO 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:20">I Kor 6:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou te achte a yon pri; pa devni esklav a lèzòm. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:20">I Kor 7:20</ref></char></note>chak moun dwe rete avèk Bondye nan menm eta ke li te resevwa apèl la.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Alò konsènan vyèj yo, mwen pa gen okenn lòd Senyè a, men mwen bay yon refleksyon kòm yon moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:1">II Kor 4:1</ref></char></note>pa mizerikòd Senyè a dign de konfyans. <verse eid="1CO 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Mwen kwè ke li bon nan sikonstans boulvès nan tan kounye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:1">I Kor 7:1</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:8">8</ref></char></note>pou yon nonm ta rete jan li ye a. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Èske ou mare ak yon madanm? Pa chache vin lib. Èske ou lib de yon madanm? Pa chache yon madanm. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Men si nou marye, nou pa peche. E si yon vyèj marye, li pa peche. Men deja moun sa yo va gen pwoblèm nan vi sa a, e m ap eseye epagne nou. <verse eid="1CO 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Men mwen di sa, frè m yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:11">Wo 13:11</ref></char></note>tan an ap vin kout. Depi koulye a, sila ki gen madanm yo ta dwe tankou yo pa t genyen; <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>epi sila ki kriye yo, tankou yo pa t kriye; sila ki rejwi yo, tankou yo pa t rejwi, e sila ki achte yo, tankou yo pa t posede anyen; <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>epi sila ki itilize mond lan, tankou yo pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:18">I Kor 9:18</ref></char></note>itilize li anpil. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:17">I Jn 2:17</ref></char></note>fòm mond sa a ap disparèt.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Men mwen vle nou libere de sousi sa a. Yon nonm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:5">I Tim 5:5</ref></char></note>pa marye sousye sèlman de zafè a Senyè a, de jan li kapab fè l kontan, <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>men yon nonm ki marye sousye de zafè a mond lan, de jan li kapab fè madanm li plezi. <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>Konsa, enterè li divize. Fanm ki pa marye a ak vyèj la, sousye de zafè a Senyè a, pou li kapab sen ni nan kò, ni nan lespri; men sila ki marye a sousye de zafè a mond lan, de jan li kapab fè mari li plezi. <verse eid="1CO 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Mwen di sa pou pwòp benefis pa nou; se pa pou jennen nou, men pou ankouraje sa ki bon, e pou vin gen yon angajman san distraksyon anvè Senyè a.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Men si yon moun panse ke l ap aji yon jan ki pa dign anvè pitit fi vyèj li, si li vin gen laj ase, e si sa dwe fèt, kite li fè sa li pito. Li pa peche. Kite li marye. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Men sila a ki kanpe fèm nan kè li, san ke li pa anba kontrent, men gen otorite sou pwòp volonte l, e ki deside sa nan pwòp kè l, pou konsève pwòp pitit fi vyèj pa li a, li va fè byen. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Konsa, sila ki bay pwòp pitit fi li a nan maryaj ap fè byen, e sila ki pa bay li nan maryaj la ap fè mye.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:2">Wo 7:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yon madanm mare selon lalwa a, ak mari li toutotan ke li vivan. Men si mari li mouri, li lib pou marye avèk sila ke li pito, men sèlman nan Senyè a. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:6">I Kor 7:6</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:25">25</ref></char></note>nan refleksyon pa m, l ap pi kontan si li rete jan li ye a. E mwen panse osi ke m gen Lespri Bondye a avè m.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Alò, konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:20">Trav 15:20</ref></char></note>bagay ki te bay kon sakrifis a zidòl yo, nou konnen ke nou tout gen konesans. Konesans fè moun awogan, men lanmou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>bay bon konprann. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:18">I Kor 3:18</ref></char></note>Si yon moun sipoze ke li konnen yon bagay, li poko <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:8">I Kor 13:8</ref></char></note>konnen jan li dwe konnen an. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Men si yon moun renmen Bondye, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:6">Sòm 1:6</ref></char></note>Bondye konnen li.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Konsa, konsènan manje bagay ki te ofri kon sakrifis a zidòl yo, nou konnen ke pa gen anyen vrèman kon zidòl nan mond lan, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Det 4:35</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:39">39</ref></char></note>pa gen okenn Dye sof ke yon sèl, Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Paske, menmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:4">II Tes 2:4</ref></char></note>genyen sa ke yo rele dye yo, swa nan syèl la oubyen sou tè a, kòm anverite gen anpil dye ak anpil senyè, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>malgre sa, nou pa gen sof ke yon Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:10">Mal 2:10</ref></char></note>Papa a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Wo 11:36</ref></char></note>De Li menm tout bagay sòti, e nou pou Li, e yon Senyè, Jésus Kris. Pa Li menm tout bagay ye, e nou egziste pa Li.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Sepandan, se pa tout moun ki gen konesans sa a. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:4">Wo 14:4</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 14:22">22</ref></char></note>kèk moun, ki abitye avèk zidòl jiska prezan, manje manje kòmsi li te sakrifye a yon zidòl, e konsyans fèb pa yo a vin souye. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Men se pa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:17">Wo 14:17</ref></char></note>manje k ap rekòmande nou a Bondye. Nou p ap ni pi mal si nou pa manje, ni pi bon si nou manje. <verse eid="1CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:13">Wo 14:13</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 14:21">21</ref></char></note>fè atansyon ke libète sa a pa vini, nan yon jan o yon lòt, yon wòch pou fè sila ki fèb yo chite. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Paske si yon moun wè ou menm, ki gen konesans, k ap manje nan yon tanp zidòl, si konsyans li fèb, l ap ankouraje manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:20">Trav 15:20</ref></char></note>bagay ki sakrifye a zidòl yo? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Alò, akoz konesans pa ou, sila ki fèb <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:15">Wo 14:15</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 14:20">20</ref></char></note>vin pèdi, frè pou sila Kris la te mouri an. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mat 18:6</ref></char></note>Konsa, nan peche kont frè nou yo k ap blese konsyans a sila ki fèb yo, nou peche kont Kris la. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Pou sa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:21">Wo 14:21</ref></char></note>si manje koze frè mwen an chite, mwen p ap janm manje vyann ankò, pou mwen pa koze frè mwen an chite.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Èske mwen pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:19">I Kor 9:19</ref></char></note>lib? Èske mwen pa yon apòt? Èske mwen pa wè Jésus, Senyè nou an? Èske nou se pa zèv mwen nan Senyè a?<verse eid="1CO 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Si pou lòt yo mwen pa yon apòt, omwen mwen se yon apòt pou nou. Paske nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:33">Jn 3:33</ref></char></note>so a ki fè m apòt nan Senyè a.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Defans mwen a sila ki jije m yo se sa:<verse eid="1CO 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:14">I Kor 9:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske nou pa gen dwa pou nou manje ak bwè?<verse eid="1CO 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 7:7">I Kor 7:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Èske nou pa gen dwa pou pran avèk nou yon madanm fidèl nan lafwa, menm jan ak rès apòt yo, frè a Senyè yo ak Céphas?<verse eid="1CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Oubyen èske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">Trav 4:36</ref></char></note>sèlman Barnabas ak mwen menm ki pa gen dwa sispann travay?<verse eid="1CO 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Kilès ki nan nenpòt tan ki sèvi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:3">II Tim 2:3</ref></char></note>kòm yon sòlda ak pwòp depans pa l? Kilès ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:6">Det 20:6</ref></char></note>plante yon chan rezen e ki pa manje fwi li? Oubyen kilès ki bèje yon bann mouton e ki pa itilize lèt bann mouton an?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Èske mwen pale bagay sa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:5">Wo 3:5</ref></char></note>jan moun refleshi? Oubyen èske lalwa pa di menm bagay sa yo tou.<verse eid="1CO 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Paske sa ekri nan Lalwa Moïse la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Det 25:4</ref></char></note>“Nou pa pou mare bouch a bèf la pandan l ap bat rekòlt la.” Èske nou kwè ke se sou zafè bèf ke Bondye ap pale a?<verse eid="1CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Oswa èske l ap pale espre pou nou? Wi, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:23">Wo 4:23</ref></char></note>pou enterè nou sa te ekri a, paske moun ki laboure tè a dwe laboure avèk espwa, e sila k ap bat rekòlt la dwe bat li avèk espwa ke l ap pataje nan rekòlt la.<verse eid="1CO 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:27">Wo 15:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si nou te simen bagay ki apatyen a Lespri ki nan nou an, èske se twòp si nou rekòlte bagay materyèl ki soti nan nou yo?<verse eid="1CO 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Si lòt yo gen dwa sou nou, èske nou menm pa gen plis?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Sepandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:33">Trav 20:33</ref></char></note>nou pa t itilize dwa sa a, men nou te sipòte tout bagay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:3">II Kor 6:3</ref></char></note>pou nou pa anpeche levanjil a Kris la.<verse eid="1CO 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Èske nou pa konnen ke sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:16">Lev 6:16</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 6:26">26</ref></char></note>fè sèvis adorasyon yo manje manje tanp lan, e sila ki toujou okipe lotèl la gen pòsyon pa yo sou lotèl la?<verse eid="1CO 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Menm jan an tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref></char></note>Senyè a te dirije sila ki pwokame levanjil yo pou twouve mwayen lavi yo nan levanjil la.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Men mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Trav 18:3</ref></char></note>pa t itilize okenn nan bagay sa yo. E mwen p ap ekri bagay sa yo pou sa kab fèt nan ka pa m nan; paske li ta pi bon pou m mouri, pase pou m kite okenn moun retire fyète m nan men m.<verse eid="1CO 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Paske si m preche levanjil la, mwen pa gen anyen pou m ta vante tèt mwen, pwiske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">Trav 9:15</ref></char></note>mwen anba obligasyon; paske malè a mwen menm si mwen pa preche levanjil la.<verse eid="1CO 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Paske si mwen fè sa volontèman, mwen deja gen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:36">Jn 4:36</ref></char></note>rekonpans. Men si se kont volonte m, mwen vin gen yon jerans ki plase sou mwen menm.<verse eid="1CO 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Konsa, kisa ki rekonpans mwen an? Sa, lè m preche levanjil la, mwen kapab ofri levanjil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Trav 18:3</ref></char></note>san frè, pou m pa sèvi tout dwa ke m gen nan levanjil la.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Paske malgre ke m lib de tout moun, mwen fè tèt mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:5">II Kor 4:5</ref></char></note>esklav a tout moun, pou m kapab konvenk plis moun toujou.<verse eid="1CO 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:3">Trav 16:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou Jwif yo mwen te vin Jwif, pou mwen te kapab konvenk Jwif yo. Pou sila ki anba Lalwa yo, kòmsi m te anba Lalwa, malgre ke mwen menm pa t anba Lalwa, pou m te kapab konvenk sila ki anba Lalwa yo.<verse eid="1CO 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Pou sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:12">Wo 2:12</ref></char></note>san lalwa yo, kòmsi m te san lalwa, malgre m pa t san lalwa a Bondye a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:2">Gal 6:2</ref></char></note>anba lalwa a Kris la, pou m te kapab konvenk sila ki san lalwa yo.<verse eid="1CO 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:1">Wo 15:1</ref></char></note>fèb yo mwen te vin fèb, pou m te kapab konvenk fèb yo. Mwen te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:33">I Kor 10:33</ref></char></note>tout bagay pou tout moun pou m ta kapab pa tout mwayen sove kèk.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Mwen fè tout bagay pou koz a levanjil la, pou m kapab vin gen dwa patisipe ladann.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Èske nou pa konnen ke nan sila yo ki kouri nan yon kous, yo tout kouri, men se yon sèl ki resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:14">Fil 3:14</ref></char></note>pri a? Kouri yon jan pou nou kapab genyen.<verse eid="1CO 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Tout moun ki patisipe nan gran jwèt yo, egzèse disiplin nan tout bagay. Yo fè sa konsa pou resevwa yon pri k ap peri, men nou menm, pou yon pri ki p ap janm peri.<verse eid="1CO 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Konsa, mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:1">Eb 12:1</ref></char></note>kouri yon jan ki pa manke gwo objektif. Mwen fè bòks yon jan pou m pa pèdi mak la.<verse eid="1CO 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Mwen disipline <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:13">Wo 8:13</ref></char></note>kò mwen pou fè l vin esklav mwen, sof ke petèt lè m fin preche a lòt yo, mwen menm ta vin pa kalifye.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Paske mwen pa vle ke nou san konprann, frè m yo, ke tout zansèt nou yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Egz 13:21</ref></char></note>anba nyaj la, e yo tout te pase nan lanmè a. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Epi yo tout te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:3">Wo 6:3</ref></char></note>batize nan Moïse nan nyaj la ak nan lanmè a; <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>e yo tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Egz 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:35">35</ref></char></note>te manje menm manje lespri a. <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>Yo tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Egz 17:6</ref></char></note>te bwè menm bwason lespri a, paske yo te bwè nan yon wòch lespri ki te swiv yo; e wòch la se te Kris la. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Sepandan, avèk pifò nan yo, Bondye pa t kontan; akoz sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Nonb 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:37">37</ref></char></note>yo te mouri nan dezè a.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Alò, bagay sa yo te rive kòm yon egzanp pou nou, pou nou pa gen move lanvi jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Nonb 11:4</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 11:34">34</ref></char></note>yo menm te gen move lanvi a. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Pa vin moun idolat tankou kèk nan yo te ye a, paske sa ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Egz 32:6</ref></char></note>“Pèp la te chita pou manje ak bwè, e te kanpe pou jwe.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Ni pou nou pa kite nou aji avèk imoralite, jan kèk nan yo te fè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:9">Nonb 25:9</ref></char></note>venn-twa-mil te tonbe nan yon sèl jou. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Ni nou pa pou tante Senyè a, jan<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5">Nonb 21:5</ref></char></note>kèk nan yo te fè a, e yo te detwi pa sèpan yo. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Ni plenyen tankou kèk nan yo te fè a, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:49">Nonb 16:49</ref></char></note>te detwi pa destriktè a. <verse eid="1CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Alò, bagay sa yo te rive yo kòm yon egzanp. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:23">Wo 4:23</ref></char></note>Yo te ekri pou enstwi nou, sou sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:11">Wo 13:11</ref></char></note>fen tan yo gen tan fin parèt. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Konsa, kite sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:20">Wo 11:20</ref></char></note>panse li kanpe a fè atansyon pou li pa tonbe.<verse eid="1CO 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Pa gen tantasyon ki parèt devan nou, ki pa menm rive devan tout moun. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:9">I Kor 1:9</ref></char></note>Bondye fidèl. Li p ap kite nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:9">II Pi 2:9</ref></char></note>tante plis ke sa nou kab sipòte, men avèk tantasyon an, Li va founi yon mwayen pou nou chape tou pou nou ka andire l.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Konsa, byeneme m yo, sove kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:7">I Kor 10:7</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 10:19">19</ref></char></note>idolatri. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Mwen pale, konsi, se ak moun saj. Byen jije sa ke mwen di a. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Lè nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:27">Mat 26:27</ref></char></note> beni tas beni a, èske nou pa pataje san Kris la? Lè nou kase pen an, èske nou pa pataje nan kò Kris la? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Paske gen yon sèl pen, nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Wo 12:5</ref></char></note>ki anpil la se yon sèl kò; paske nou tout pataje yon sèl pen. <verse eid="1CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Gade nasyon Israël la selon lachè a. Èske se pa tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lev 7:6</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 7:14">14</ref></char></note>manje sakrifis ki pataje sou lotèl yo?<verse eid="1CO 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Kisa mwen vle di konsa? Ke yon bagay ki te sakrifye a zidòl se yon bagay, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:4">I Kor 8:4</ref></char></note>ke yon zidòl se yon bagay? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Non, men mwen di bagay yo ke pèp payen yo sèvi nan sakrifis yo, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Det 32:17</ref></char></note>sakrifye bay dyab yo, e pa a Bondye; epi mwen pa vle nou devni moun k ap pataje bagay bay dyab.<verse eid="1CO 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 6:16">II Kor 6:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou pa kapab bwè tas Senyè a ak tas a dyab yo. Nou pa kapab pataje tab a Senyè a, ak tab a dyab yo. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Oubyen èske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Det 32:21</ref></char></note>pouse Senyè a a jalouzi? Èske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 6:10">Ekl 6:10</ref></char></note>pi fò pase Li?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:12">I Kor 6:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout bagay pèmèt, men se pa tout bagay ki itil. Tout bagay pèmèt, men se pa tout bagay ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>edifye. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Pa kite nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:2">Wo 15:2</ref></char></note> chache pwòp enterè pa nou, men sa ki bon pou vwazen nou. <verse eid="1CO 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:15">Trav 10:15</ref></char></note>Manje avèk bon konsyans nenpòt vyann ki vann nan mache, san poze kesyon. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Sòm 24:1</ref></char></note>“Paske tè a se pou Senyè a avèk tout sa ki ladann.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:10">I Kor 5:10</ref></char></note>youn nan sila ki pa kwè yo envite nou, e nou vle ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:8">Luc 10:8</ref></char></note>manje nenpòt bagay ke yo mete devan nou, avèk bon konsyans e san poze kesyon. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Men si yon moun di nou: “Vyann sa a te sakrifye bay zidòl,” pa manje l, pou kòz a sila ki te enfòme nou an, ak pou bon konsyans. Paske “Latè se pou Senyè, ak tout ki ranpli l.” <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Mwen pa vle di pwòp konsyans pa nou, men konsyans pa li. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:16">Wo 14:16</ref></char></note>poukisa libète mwen vin jije pa konsyans a yon lòt? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Si mwen patisipe avèk remèsiman, poukisa libète mwen mal jije pou sa ke mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:6">Wo 14:6</ref></char></note>bay remèsiman?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Alò, konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:17">Kol 3:17</ref></char></note>si nou manje oswa si nou bwè, nan nenpòt sa ke nou fè, fè yo tout a laglwa Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:16">Trav 24:16</ref></char></note>Pa ofanse ni Jwif, ni Grèk, ni legliz Bondye a.<verse eid="1CO 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Menm jan ke mwen osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:2">Wo 15:2</ref></char></note>fè tout moun plezi nan tout bagay, pa pou chache pwòp enterè pa m, men enterè a anpil moun, jis pou yo kapab sove.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">I Kor 4:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se pou nou vin imitatè a mwen menm, menm jan ke mwen osi se imitatè a Kris la.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Alò mwen fè nou konpliman akoz ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:6">I Tes 1:6</ref></char></note>sonje mwen nan tout bagay, e nou kenbe fèm a tout sa ke m enstwi nou yo, jis jan ke m te livre yo bannou an. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Men mwen vle nou konprann ke Kris se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:23">Ef 5:23</ref></char></note>tèt a tout gason, gason se tèt a fanm nan, e Bondye se tèt a Kris la. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Tout gason ki gen yon bagay sou tèt li pandan l ap priye oubyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:1">Trav 13:1</ref></char></note>pwofetize, dezonore tèt li. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Men chak fanm ki kite tèt li dekouvri pandan l ap priye oubyen pwofetize, dezonore tèt li. Paske li vin menm jan avèk yon fanm ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:12">Det 21:12</ref></char></note>pase razwa nan tèt li. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Paske si yon fanm pa kouvri tèt li, kite li koupe cheve l tou. Men si se yon dezonè pou yon fanm koupe cheve li, oswa pase razwa nan tèt li, kite li kouvri tèt li. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Paske yon gason pa ta dwe kouvri tèt li akoz ke li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Jen 1:26</ref></char></note>imaj ak glwa a Bondye, men fanm nan se glwa a gason. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21-23">Jen 2:21-23</ref></char></note>gason pa soti nan fanm, men fanm soti nan gason. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Paske, gason pa t kreye pou koz a fanm nan, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18">Jen 2:18</ref></char></note>fanm nan pou koz a gason an. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Konsa, fanm nan dwe gen yon siyal otorite sou tèt li akoz zanj yo.<verse eid="1CO 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Sepandan, nan Senyè a, ni fanm nan pa endepandan de gason an, ni gason an pa endepandan de fanm nan. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Paske menm jan ke fanm nan sòti nan gason an, osi gason an gen nesans li atravè fanm nan; men tout bagay sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Wo 11:36</ref></char></note>nan Bondye. <verse eid="1CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:57">Luc 12:57</ref></char></note>Jije nou menm: èske li bon pou yon fanm priye Bondye avèk tèt li dekouvri? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Èske menm lanati li menm pa enstwi nou ke si yon nonm gen cheve long, se yon dezonè pou li, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>men si yon fanm gen cheve long, se yon glwa pou li? Paske cheve li te donnen kon yon kouvèti pou li. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Men si yon moun ta vle diskite kont sa, ni nou menm, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:17">I Kor 7:17</ref></char></note>legliz Bondye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:5">I Kor 4:5</ref></char></note>pa pou gen okenn lòt pratik.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Men lè mwen bay nou komman sila a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:2">I Kor 11:2</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 11:22">22</ref></char></note>mwen pa fè nou konpliman, paske nou pa reyini ansanm pou sa ki pi bon men pou sa ki pi mal. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Paske premyèman, lè nou reyini ansanm kòm yon legliz, mwen tande ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:10">I Kor 1:10</ref></char></note>gen divizyon pami nou, e mwen kwè yon pati nan sa gen verite. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Paske toujou oblije gen divizyon pami nou jis pou sila ki apwouve yo kapab vin parèt klè pami nou. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Konsa, lè nou reyini ansanm, nou pa fè l pou nou manje manje Senyè a. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Olye sa, nan manje a, chak moun pran pwòp manje pa l avan. Yon moun grangou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:12">Jd 12</ref></char></note>yon lòt sou. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Kisa! Nou pa gen kay kote nou kapab manje ak bwè? Oubyen èske nou meprize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:32">I Kor 10:32</ref></char></note>legliz Bondye a, e fè sila ki manke yo wont? Kisa m kapab di nou? Èske m dwe fè nou konpliman? Nan sa, mwen p ap fè nou konpliman.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Paske mwen te resevwa soti nan Senyè a sa ke m te livre bannou an, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">I Kor 11:23-25</ref></char></note>Senyè a Jésus, nan nwit ke Li te trayi a, te pran pen an. <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>Lè L te fin bay remèsiman, li te kase li e te di: <char style="wj">“Pran, manje. Sa se kò Mwen ki kase pou nou. Fè sa nan memwa a Mwen menm.” </char> <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Menm jan an, apre soupe a li te pran tas la osi e te di: <char style="wj">“Tas sa a se </char> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:20">Luc 22:20</ref></char></note><char style="wj">akò tounèf nan san Mwen an. Tout tan ke nou bwè li, fè sa nan memwa a Mwen menm.”</char> <verse eid="1CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Paske tout tan ke nou manje pen sa a, e bwè tas sa a, nou pwoklame lanmò Senyè a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:22">Jn 21:22</ref></char></note>jiskaske Li vini.<verse eid="1CO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Konsa, nenpòt moun ki manje pen an oubyen bwè tas Senyè a nan yon fason ki pa dign, va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:29">Eb 10:29</ref></char></note>koupab de kò ak san Senyè a. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Men yon moun dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:22">Mat 26:22</ref></char></note>egzamine tèt li, e konsa kite li manje pen an e bwè tas la. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Paske sila ki manje e ki bwè nan yon jan ke li pa merite, manje e bwè jijman sou tèt li si li pa byen jije kò Senyè a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:60">Trav 7:60</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Pou rezon sa a, anpil pami nou fèb, malad, e kèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:60">Trav 7:60</ref></char></note> mouri. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Men si nou te byen jije pwòp tèt nou, nou pa t ap vin jije. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Men lè nou vin jije, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">II Sam 7:14</ref></char></note> korije pa Senyè a pou nou pa vin kondane ansanm avèk mond lan. <verse eid="1CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Konsa, frè m yo, lè nou reyini ansanm pou nou manje, se pou nou tann youn lòt. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Si yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:21">I Kor 11:21</ref></char></note>grangou, ke li manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:22">I Kor 11:22</ref></char></note>lakay li, pou nou pa reyini ansanm pou jijman. Rès bagay yo mwen va regle yo lè m vini.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Alò, konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4">I Kor 12:4</ref></char></note>don Lespri Sen yo, frè m yo, mwen pa vle nou enkonsyan de yo. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:11">I Kor 6:11</ref></char></note>Nou konnen ke lè nou te payen, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:9">I Tes 1:9</ref></char></note>mennen egare kote zidòl ki pa t kapab pale yo, nenpòt jan yo ta ka mennen nou. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Konsa, mwen fè nou konnen ke pa gen pèsòn k ap pale pa Lespri Bondye a ki di: “Jésus madichonnen”. Ni pèsòn p ap ka di: “Jésus se Senyè a”, eksepte <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:43">Mat 22:43</ref></char></note> pa Lespri Sen an.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Alò, gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Wo 12:6</ref></char></note>plizyè kalitie don, men se menm Lespri a. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Gen plizyè kalite ministè, e menm Senyè a. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Gen plizyè kalite fonksyon, men menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:28">I Kor 15:28</ref></char></note>Bondye a ki fè tout bagay fonksyone nan tout moun. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Men chak kwayan resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12-30">I Kor 12:12-30</ref></char></note>don Lespri a, pou lavantaj a tout moun. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Paske a yon moun pawòl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:6">I Kor 2:6</ref></char></note>sajès la bay selon Lespri a, e a yon lòt pawòl konesans lan selon menm Lespri a. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>A yon lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:2">I Kor 13:2</ref></char></note>lafwa pa menm Lespri a, e a yon lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:28">I Kor 12:28</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 12:30">30</ref></char></note>don gerizon pa Lespri a, <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>epi a yon lòt don pou fè mirak, e a yon lòt, pwofesi, e a yon lòt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:29">I Kor 14:29</ref></char></note>kapasite pou distenge pami lespri yo, a yon lòt plizyè kalite langaj, e a yon lòt, pou entèprete lang yo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Men youn e menm Lespri a travay nan tout bagay sa yo, e Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4">I Kor 12:4</ref></char></note>distribiye yo a chak grenn moun selon volonte Li.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Paske menm jan ke kò a se yon sèl, men gen anpil manm, e tout manm kò yo, malgre ke yo anpil, yo se yon sèl kò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:27">I Kor 12:27</ref></char></note>konsa tou Kris la ye. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:18">Ef 2:18</ref></char></note>pa yon sèl Lespri, nou tout te batize nan yon sèl kò, kit Jwif, kit Grèk, kit esklav, kit lib, e nou tout te fèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:37-39">Jn 7:37-39</ref></char></note>bwè nan yon sèl Lespri.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:20">I Kor 12:20</ref></char></note>kò a se pa yon sèl manm, men anpil manm. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Si pye a ta di: “Akoz ke mwen se pa yon men, mwen pa yon pati nan kò a,” se pa sa ki ta fè l okenn mwens yon pati nan kò a. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Epi si zòrèy la di: “Mwen pa yon zye, mwen pa yon pati nan kò a,” se pa pou rezon sa a li pa omwen yon pati nan kò a. <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Si tout kò a te yon zye, kote zòrèy la t ap ye? Si tout kò a te sèl zòrèy, kote nen pou santi t ap ye? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Men koulye a Bondye byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:28">I Kor 12:28</ref></char></note>plase manm yo, yo chak nan kò a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Wo 12:6</ref></char></note>jis jan Li te vle a. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Si yo tout te yon sèl manm, kote kò a t ap ye? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Men koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">I Kor 12:12</ref></char></note>gen anpil manm, men yon sèl kò. <verse eid="1CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Konsa, zye a pa kapab di a men an: “Mwen pa bezwen ou” ni ankò, tèt la a pye yo: “Mwen pa bezwen nou.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Okontrè, li pi vrè ke manm kò ki sanble pi fèb yo nesesè. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Epi manm nan kò yo ke nou estime mwens onorab yo, sou yo nou bay plis onè, e manm ki mwens prezantab nou yo, vin pi prezantab, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>pandan ke manm pi prezantab nou yo pa bezwen sa. Men Bondye byen ranje kò a pou bay plis onè a manm ki manke onè yo, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>jis pou pa vin gen divizyon nan kò a, men pou manm yo kapab gen menm sousi pou youn lòt. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Si yon manm soufri, pou tout manm yo soufri avèk li. Si yon manm resevwa onè, pou tout manm yo rejwi avèk li.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Alò ansanm, nou se kò a Kris la, e nou se chak grenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Wo 12:5</ref></char></note>manm de li. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Konsa, Bondye te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:18">I Kor 12:18</ref></char></note>chwazi nan legliz la, premyèman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Ef 4:11</ref></char></note>apot yo, dezyèmman, pwofèt yo, twazyèmman, enstriktè yo, answit don mirak yo, answit don gerizon yo, èd yo, administrasyon yo, plizyè kalite langaj yo. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Èske se tout ki apot? Non! Èske tout se pwofèt? Non! Èske tout se enstriktè? Non Èske se tout ki fè mirak? Non! <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Èske tout fè gerizon? Non! Èske tout pale an lang? Non! Èske tout entèprete? Non! <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:1">I Kor 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 14:39">39</ref></char></note>swayezman kiltive dezi pou pi gran don yo. E mwen va montre nou yon chemen ki toujou pi ekselan.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Si mwen pale avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:10">I Kor 12:10</ref></char></note>lang a lèzòm ak zanj yo, men mwen pa gen lanmou, mwen tankou yon klòch k ap fè gwo bwi oubyen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 150:5">Sòm 150:5</ref></char></note>senbal k ap sone. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Si m gen don pwofesi, e konnen tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:10">I Kor 12:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 12:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 12:30">30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">I Kor 13:2</ref></char></note>mistè ak tout konesans; epi si mwen gen tout lafwa, kòmsi pou m ta kapab deplase mòn yo, men mwen pa gen lanmou, mwen pa anyen. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Si mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:2">Mat 6:2</ref></char></note>bay tout sa ke m posede pou bay manje a pòv yo, e si mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:28">Dan 3:28</ref></char></note>livre kò m pou brile, men mwen pa gen lanmou, sa p ap rapòte m anyen.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Lanmou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Pwov 10:12</ref></char></note>pasyan, lanmou dous; li pa jalou. Lanmou pa vante tèt li e li pa awogan. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Li pa aji malonètman, ni li pa chache pwòp enterè pa l. Li pa fè kòlè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:19">II Kor 5:19</ref></char></note>pa teni kont de mal li resevwa. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Li pa rejwi nan lenjistis, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2JN 1:4">II Jn 4</ref></char></note>rejwi nan verite a. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:12">I Kor 9:12</ref></char></note>sipòte tout bagay, kwè tout bagay, espere tout bagay, andire tout bagay.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Lanmou pa janm disparèt. Si gen don <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:2">I Kor 13:2</ref></char></note>pwofesi, y ap vin disparèt. Si gen don <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:1">I Kor 13:1</ref></char></note>lang, yo va fini. Si gen konesans, li va anile. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Paske nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:2">I Kor 8:2</ref></char></note>konnen yon ti pati e nou pwofetize yon ti pati; <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>men lè sa ki pafè a vini, sa ki poko konplè a va disparèt. <verse eid="1CO 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Lè m te timoun, mwen te konn pale tankou yon timoun, panse tankou yon timoun, rezone tankou yon timoun. Lè m te vin gran, mwen te kite bagay timoun yo. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Paske koulye a nou wè twoub, konsi nan yon glas, men answit nou va wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:30">Jen 32:30</ref></char></note>fasafas. Koulye a m konnen yon ti pati, men answit, mwen va konnen tout bagay menm jan ke Bondye konnen tout bagay de mwen an. <verse eid="1CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Men koulye a, lafwa, lesperans, ak lanmou; rete twa bagay sa yo. Men pi gran nan bagay sa yo, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref></char></note>lanmou.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 16:14">I Kor 16:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pouswiv lanmou, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:31">I Kor 12:31</ref></char></note>dezire ak tout kè nou, don Lespri yo, sitou don pou nou kapab pwofetize a.<verse eid="1CO 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Paske sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:10">I Kor 12:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 12:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 12:30">30</ref></char></note>pale an lang yo pa pale ak moun, men ak Bondye; paske pèsòn pa konprann, men nan lespri li, li pale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:2">I Kor 13:2</ref></char></note>mistè yo.<verse eid="1CO 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Men yon moun ki pwofetize pale ak moun pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>fè yo konprann plis, pou egzòte yo, e pou konsole yo.<verse eid="1CO 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Sila ki pale an lang lan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>edifye tèt li, men sila ki pwofetize a edifye legliz la.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Alò, mwen ta kontan si nou tout te pale an lang <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:29">Nonb 11:29</ref></char></note>men menm plis, ke nou tout ta pwofetize. Paske pi gran an se sila ki pwofetize a, pase sila ki pale an lang lan, amwenske li entèprete, pou legliz la kapab vin edifye.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Men alò, frè m yo, si mwen vini a nou menm e m ap pale an lang, ki pwofi mwen ye pou nou si omwen mwen pa pale ak nou selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:26">I Kor 14:26</ref></char></note>revelasyon, konesans, pwofesi oswa enstriksyon?<verse eid="1CO 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Paske menm bagay ki pa gen lavi nan yo, tankou flit, oswa ap, lè yo fè yon son, si li pa yon son ki klè, kijan nou ka fè konnen si sa k ap jwe a se flit la, oswa ap la?<verse eid="1CO 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Paske si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:9">Nonb 10:9</ref></char></note>twonpèt la pwodwi yon son ki pa klè, kijan yon moun va prepare tèt li pou batay la?<verse eid="1CO 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Donk nou menm tou, sof ke nou pale an lang pawòl ki klè, kijan yo va konnen sa ki pale a? Paske si li pa konsa, se konsi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:26">I Kor 9:26</ref></char></note>nou pale pawòl anlè.<verse eid="1CO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Genyen, petèt, anpil kalite lang nan mond lan, e okenn pa san konprann.<verse eid="1CO 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Si, alò, mwen pa konprann lang lan, a sila ki pale li a, mwen va tankou yon sovaj, e sila ki pale a va yon sovaj pou mwen.<verse eid="1CO 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Alò, nou menm osi, paske nou gen zèl pou don Lespri yo, toujou chèche ranpli ak yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:9">Wo 14:9</ref></char></note>edifikasyon legliz la.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Konsa, kite sila ki pale an lang lan priye pou li kapab osi entèprete li.<verse eid="1CO 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Paske si mwen priye nan yon lang, lespri mwen priye, men entèlijans mwen rete san fwi.<verse eid="1CO 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Ki konklizyon alò? Ke mwen va priye avèk lespri a, e mwen va priye avèk entèlijans la osi. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19">Ef 5:19</ref></char></note>chante avèk lespri a, e mwen va chante avèk entèlijans la osi.<verse eid="1CO 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Otreman, si nou beni nan lespri a sèlman, kijan sila ki okipe plas moun ki san don yo va di <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:15-26">Det 27:15-26</ref></char></note>“Amen” lè nou bay remèsiman, paske li menm, li pa konnen sa n ap di a?<verse eid="1CO 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Paske nou ap bay remèsiman ase byen, men lòt moun nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>pa edifye.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Mwen remèsye Bondye m, mwen pale an lang plis ke nou tout.<verse eid="1CO 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Sepandan, nan legliz la mwen pito pale senk mo avèk entèlijans mwen, pou m kapab enstwi lòt yo osi, olye di-mil mo an lang.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:14">Ef 4:14</ref></char></note>pa fè tankou timoun nan jan nou reflechi. Nan sa ki mal la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref></char></note>rete inosan tankou tibebe, men nan jan nou panse, reflechi tankou granmoun.<verse eid="1CO 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Nan Lalwa a, li ekri: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:1">És 28:1</ref></char></note>“Pa lèzòm ak lang etranje yo, e pa bouch etranje yo mwen va pale a pèp sila a, e malgre sa, yo p ap koute Mwen,” di Senyè a.<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Kidonk, lang yo se pou yon sign, pa pou sila ki kwè yo, men pou enkwayan yo; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:1">I Kor 14:1</ref></char></note>pwofetize se yon sign, pa pou enkwayan yo, men pou sila ki kwè yo.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Donk, si tout legliz la reyini ansanm e yo tout pale an lang, e moun ki san don oubyen enkwayan yo antre, èske yo p ap di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:13">Trav 2:13</ref></char></note>nou fou?<verse eid="1CO 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Men si nou tout ap pwofetize, e yon enkwayan oubyen yon moun ki san don antre, l ap vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:8">Jn 16:8</ref></char></note>konvenk pa tout bagay. Konsa, li va rele pou vin rann kont de tout bagay. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Sekrè a kè li vin devwale, e konsa li va tonbe sou fas li pou adore Bondye e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:14">És 45:14</ref></char></note>deklare ke Bondye an verite pami nou.<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Alò ki rezilta frè m yo? Lè nou reyini, chak moun gen yon sòm, gen yon enstriksyon, gen yon revelasyon, gen yon lang, gen yon entèpretasyon. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:19">Wo 14:19</ref></char></note>Ke tout bagay fèt pou edifikasyon yon lòt.<verse eid="1CO 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Si yon moun pale an lang, li ta dwe pa plis ke de moun, o menm twa. Fòk li an lòd, youn apre lòt, e yon moun dwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:10">I Kor 12:10</ref></char></note>entèprete.<verse eid="1CO 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Men si pa gen entèprèt, li dwe rete an silans nan legliz la, e kite li pale ak tèt li e ak Bondye.<verse eid="1CO 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Kite de oubyen twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:32">I Kor 14:32</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 14:37">37</ref></char></note>pwofèt pale, e kite lòt yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:10">I Kor 12:10</ref></char></note>jije sa.<verse eid="1CO 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Men si yon revelasyon vin fèt a yon moun ki chita, premye a dwe fè silans.<verse eid="1CO 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Paske nou tout kapab pwofetize youn apre lòt, pou nou tout kapab konprann e nou tout kapab jwenn egzòtasyon.<verse eid="1CO 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Konsa, lespri a pwofèt yo se sijè a pwofèt yo.<verse eid="1CO 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Paske Bondye se pa yon Bondye ki mennen konfizyon, men lapè, tankou nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">I Kor 4:17</ref></char></note>tout legliz a sen yo.<verse eid="1CO 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>Ke fanm yo rete an silans nan legliz la; paske yo pa pèmèt pou yo pale, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:11">I Tim 2:11</ref></char></note>kite yo vin anba lòd, jan Lalwa anplis konn di a.<verse eid="1CO 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Si yo dezire aprann yon bagay, kite yo mande pwòp mari yo lakay yo; paske se pa pwòp pou yon fanm pale nan legliz la.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Ki sa a? Èske se nan nou menm pawòl Bondye a te sòti premyèman? Oubyen èske li vini a nou menm sèlman?<verse eid="1CO 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 10:7">II Kor 10:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Si yon moun panse ke li se yon pwofèt, oswa plen lespri, kite li rekonèt ke bagay ke mwen ekri a nou menm yo se kòmandman a Senyè a.<verse eid="1CO 14:37"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Men si yon moun pa rekonèt sa, li menm, osi li p ap rekonèt.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Konsa, frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:31">I Kor 12:31</ref></char></note>Se pou nou gen yon dezi sensè pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:1">I Kor 14:1</ref></char></note>pwofetize, e pa anpeche moun pale an lang.<verse eid="1CO 14:39"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:33">I Kor 14:33</ref></char></note>tout bagay dwe fèt byen pwòp ak nan lòd.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Koulye a, mwen fè konnen a nou menm, frè m yo, levanjil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:2">Wo 5:2</ref></char></note>ke mwen te preche a nou an, ke osi nou te resevwa a ladann osi nou kanpe. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Pa li menm osi nou ap sove, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:22">Wo 11:22</ref></char></note>si nou kenbe fèm a pawòl ke m te preche a nou an, amwenske nou te kwè anven.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Paske mwen te livre a nou kon bagay ki pi enpòtan nan sa ke mwen osi te resevwa a, ke Kris la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:4">Gal 1:4</ref></char></note>mouri pou peche nou yo selon Ekriti sen yo, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>ke Li te antere, e ke Li te leve nan twazyèm jou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8">Sòm 16:8</ref></char></note>selon Ekriti yo. <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Epi ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luc 24:34</ref></char></note>Li te parèt a Céphas, e answit, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luc 24:36</ref></char></note>douz yo. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Apre sa, Li te parèt a plis ke senk san frè yon sèl kou, pifò nan yo rete la jiska prezan, malgre kèk nan yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:60">Trav 7:60</ref></char></note>gen tan mouri. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Answit Li te parèt a Jacques, e answit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:33">Luc 24:33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 24:36">36</ref></char></note>tout apot yo. <verse eid="1CO 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Epi an dènye, tankou youn pitit ki pa t fèt nan pwòp moman an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-8">Trav 9:3-8</ref></char></note>Li te parèt a mwen menm tou.<verse eid="1CO 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Paske mwen se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:15">I Tim 1:15</ref></char></note>pi piti a pami apot yo, e ki pa menm dign pou rele apot, paske mwen te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>pèsekite legliz Bondye a.<verse eid="1CO 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Men, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Wo 12:3</ref></char></note>gras Bondye, mwen sa ke mwen ye a, e gras Li anvè mwen pa anven, men mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:23">II Kor 11:23</ref></char></note>travay menm plis pase yo tout, malgre se pa t mwen, men gras a Bondye ki te avè m nan.<verse eid="1CO 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Alò, kit se te pa mwen, kit se te pa yo, konsa nou te preche, epi konsa nou tout te kwè.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Alò, si Kris la preche, ke Li te leve nan lanmò, kijan kèk pami nou ap di ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:32">Trav 17:32</ref></char></note>pa gen rezirèksyon mò yo? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Si pa gen rezirèksyon pou mò yo, menm Kris la pa t leve. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:14">I Tes 4:14</ref></char></note>si Kris la pa t leve, answit nou ap preche anven, e lafwa nou osi anven. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Anplis ke sa, nou menm vin twouve nou kòm fo temwen a Bondye, paske nou te temwaye kont Bondye, ke Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24">Trav 2:24</ref></char></note>leve Kris la, ke Li pa t leve vrèman, si anfèt mò yo pa leve. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Paske si mò yo pa leve, menm Kris la pa t leve.<verse eid="1CO 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Epi si Kris la pa t leve, lafwa nou vin san valè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:25">Wo 4:25</ref></char></note>nou toujou nan peche nou yo.<verse eid="1CO 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Answit sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:6">I Kor 15:6</ref></char></note>mouri nan Kris yo peri.<verse eid="1CO 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Konsa, si nou te mete espwa nou nan Kris sèlman nan vi sa a, nou pami moun ki pi pitwayab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:9">I Kor 4:9</ref></char></note>ke tout moun.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Men alò, Kris te vrèman leve soti nan lanmò, kon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:23">I Kor 15:23</ref></char></note>premye fwi de sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:16">I Tes 4:16</ref></char></note>ki mouri yo. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Paske si se pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12">Wo 5:12</ref></char></note>yon sèl moun, lanmò te vini, pa yon moun osi, rezirèksyon mò yo te vini. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:14-18">Wo 5:14-18</ref></char></note>tankou nan Adam tout moun te mouri an, menm jan an tou nan Kris tout moun va gen lavi.<verse eid="1CO 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Men chak moun nan pwòp lòd li: Kris, kon premye fwi yo, apre sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:16">I Tes 4:16</ref></char></note>sila ki nan Kris yo lè L vini. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Answit va vini lafen, lè Li livre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref></char></note>wayòm nan a Bondye, Papa a, lè Li fin aboli tout wayòm yo, tout otorite yo, avèk tout pwisans yo. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Paske fòk li renye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sòm 110:1</ref></char></note>jiskaske Li mete tout lènmi Li yo anba pye Li. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Dènye lènmi ki va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:10">II Tim 1:10</ref></char></note>aboli a se lanmò.<verse eid="1CO 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Sòm 8:6</ref></char></note>“Li te fè tout bagay soumèt anba pye Li.” Men lè Li di: “Tout bagay soumèt”, li byen klè ke Li menm ki te fè tout bagay soumèt a Li menm nan, pa ladann.<verse eid="1CO 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Lè tout bagay soumèt a Li menm, answit Fis la, Li menm, osi va vin soumèt a Sila ki te soumèt tout bagay a Li menm nan, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:6">I Kor 12:6</ref></char></note>Bondye kapab tout nan tout bagay.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Otreman, kisa sila yo ki batize pou mò yo va fè? Si mò yo pa leve menm, alò poukisa yo batize pou yo? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Poukisa nou menm tou, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:26">II Kor 11:26</ref></char></note>an danje a chak moman? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Mwen dakò fè nou konnen, frè m yo, pa fyète ke m gen nan nou, ak nan Jésus Kri Senyè nou an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:36">Wo 8:36</ref></char></note>mwen mouri chak jou.<verse eid="1CO 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Si se te pou yon motif moun ke m te goumen avèk bèt sovaj chak jou an Éphèse yo, ki pwofi sa t ap ban mwen? Si mò yo pa leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">És 22:13</ref></char></note>“Annou manje ak bwè, paske demen n ap mouri.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref></char></note>Pa twonpe tèt nou: “Move zanmi gate bon prensip.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Vin reflechi byen serye jan nou ta dwe fè a, e sispann fè peche; paske kèk nan nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:29">Mat 22:29</ref></char></note>pa menm gen konesans a Bondye. Mwen pale sa pou fè nou wont.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Men yon moun va di: “Kijan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:24">Jn 12:24</ref></char></note>mò yo leve a?” Epi “avèk ki kalite kò yo ap vini?”<verse eid="1CO 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Moun sòt! Sa ke nou simen pa kapab vin gen lavi amwenske li mouri; <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Epi sa ke nou simen an, nou pa simen kò a li menm, men yon senp ti grenn, petèt yon ble oubyen yon lòt bagay.<verse eid="1CO 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Men Bondye bay li yon kò jis jan ke Li te dezire a, e a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:11">Gal 1:11</ref></char></note>chak grenn semans yo yon kò pou kont li. <verse eid="1CO 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Tout chè pa menm kalite chè. Gen yon chè pou lòm, e yon lòt chè pou bèt, yon lòt chè pou zwazo, e yon lòt pou pwason. <verse eid="1CO 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Gen osi kò selès ak kò tèrès, men laglwa selès la se youn, e laglwa tèrès la se yon lòt. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Gen yon glwa nan solèy la, yon lòt glwa nan lalin lan, e yon lòt nan zetwal yo; paske chak zetwal apa nan glwa li.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Menm jan an tou pou rezirèksyon a mò yo. Li simen kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:21">Wo 8:21</ref></char></note>yon kò perisab, men li leve kòm yon kò enperisab.<verse eid="1CO 15:42"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Li simen nan dezonè, li leve nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:21">Fil 3:21</ref></char></note>laglwa. Li simen nan feblès, li leve nan pouvwa.<verse eid="1CO 15:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Li simen kòm yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:14">I Kor 2:14</ref></char></note>kò natirèl; li leve kòm yon kò espirityèl. Si gen yon kò natirèl, anplis gen yon kò espirityèl.<verse eid="1CO 15:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Menm jan an osi sa ekri: “Premye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Jen 2:7</ref></char></note>lòm nan, Adam, te devni yon nanm vivan.” Dènye Adam an, Jésus Kris, yon lespri ki bay lavi. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Sepandan, sa ki gen lespri a pa vini avan, men sa ki natirèl la, answit sa ki gen lespri a. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Premye lòm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:31">Jn 3:31</ref></char></note>sòti nan latè. Li se moun tèrès. Dezyèm lòm nan sòti nan syèl la. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Jan tè a ye a, se konsa sila ki tèrès yo ye tou; e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:20">Fil 3:20</ref></char></note>menm jan selès la ye a, konsa selès yo ye tou. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Jis jan ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 5:3">Jen 5:3</ref></char></note>pote imaj a tèrès la, konsa osi nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Wo 8:29</ref></char></note>va pote imaj a selès la. <verse eid="1CO 15:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Alò m ap di sa, frè m yo, ke chè ak san pa kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref></char></note>eritye wayòm Bondye a; ni sa ki perisab la pa kapab eritye sa ki enperisab la.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Gade byen, m ap di nou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:2">I Kor 13:2</ref></char></note>mistè. Se pa nou tout ki va mouri, men nou tout va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2">II Kor 5:2</ref>,<ref loc="2CO 5:4">4</ref></char></note>chanje, <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>nan yon moman, nan yon ti bat zye, nan dènye twonpèt la. Paske twonpèt la va sone, mò yo va vin leve enperisab, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15">I Tes 4:15</ref>,<ref loc="1TH 4:17">17</ref></char></note>nou tout va vin chanje. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Paske perisab la dwe abiye avèk enperisab la, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:4">II Kor 5:4</ref></char></note>mòtèl sa a dwe abiye avèk imòtalite. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Men lè perisab sila a fin abiye avèk enperisab la, e mòtèl sila a fin abiye avèk imòtalite a, alò va vin akonpli pawòl ki ekri a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">És 25:8</ref></char></note>“Lanmò vin vale nèt pa viktwa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Os 13:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“O lanmò, kote viktwa ou? O lanmò, kote doulè pikan an?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Doulè pikan lanmò a se peche, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">Wo 3:20</ref></char></note>pouvwa a peche a se Lalwa a.<verse eid="1CO 15:56"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Men gras a Bondye, ki bannou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:37">Wo 8:37</ref></char></note>viktwa atravè Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1CO 15:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Pou sa, byeneme frè m yo, rete fidèl, san varye, toujou ranpli avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:10">I Kor 16:10</ref></char></note>bon zèv Senyè a, avèk konesans ke travay nou nan Senyè a pa anven.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Koulye a konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:17">Trav 24:17</ref></char></note>ofrann pou sen yo; jan mwen te dirije legliz Galatie yo, konsa mwen fè nou konnen tou. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Nan premye jou nan semèn nan, ke nou chak mete sou kote e sere, selon jan li te byen reyisi, pou okenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:4">II Kor 9:4</ref></char></note>ofrann pa fèt lè m vini. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Konsa, lè m rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:1">II Kor 3:1</ref></char></note>nenpòt moun ke nou ta kab chwazi, mwen va voye yo avèk lèt pou pote kado nou an Jérusalem; <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>epi si li nesesè pou m ale tou, yo va ale avè m.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Men mwen va vini a nou menm apre mwen pase Macédoine, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Trav 19:21</ref></char></note>m ap pase Macédoine. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Petèt mwen va rete avèk nou, oswa menm pase sezon livè a, pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:3">Trav 15:3</ref></char></note>voye m ale nenpòt kote ke m ta kab ale. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Paske mwen pa vle wè nou koulye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:15">II Kor 1:15</ref></char></note>sèlman an pasan; paske mwen espere rete avèk nou pou kèk tan si Dye vle. <verse eid="1CO 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Men mwen va rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">Trav 18:19</ref></char></note>Éphèse jiska fèt pannkot la; <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Paske yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">Trav 14:27</ref></char></note>pòt byen laj e efikas vin louvri a mwen menm, e gen anpil advèsè.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Alò, si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">I Kor 4:17</ref></char></note>Timothée vini, fè si ke li avèk nou san koz pou pè; paske l ap fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:58">I Kor 15:58</ref></char></note>travay a Bondye a, menm jan mwen ap fè l la. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Donk, pa kite pèsòn meprize li. Men voye l al fè wout li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:33">Trav 15:33</ref></char></note>anpè, pou li kapab vin jwenn mwen; paske m ap tann li avèk frè yo.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Men konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Trav 18:24</ref></char></note>Apollos, frè nou an, mwen te ankouraje li anpil pou li vin jwenn nou avèk frè yo. Li pa t vle vini koulye a, men li va vini lè li gen opòtinite. <verse eid="1CO 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:42">Mat 24:42</ref></char></note>Rete vijilan, kanpe fèm nan lafwa, pran kouraj, mete nou dyanm. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Ke tout sa ke nou fè, fèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:1">I Kor 14:1</ref></char></note>ak lanmou.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Alò, mwen ankouraje nou, frè m yo (nou konnen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:16">I Kor 1:16</ref></char></note>lakay Stéphanas, ke yo te premye fwi nan Achaïe e ke yo te bay tèt yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:31">Wo 15:31</ref></char></note>ministè a sen yo). <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:12">I Tes 5:12</ref></char></note>nou osi vin soumèt a kalite moun sa yo e a tout moun ki ede nan zèv ak travay la. <verse eid="1CO 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Mwen rejwi de rive a Stéphanas ak Fortunatus ak Achaïcus paske yo te founi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">II Kor 11:9</ref></char></note>sa ki te manke nan pati a nou menm. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Paske yo te renouvle lespri mwen ak lespri pa nou osi. Donk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:29">Fil 2:29</ref></char></note>se pou nou rekonèt moun tankou sa yo.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Legliz Asie yo salye nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Trav 18:2</ref></char></note>Aquilas avèk Priscille salye nou avèk tout kè yo nan Senyè a, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:5">Wo 16:5</ref></char></note>legliz ki lakay yo a. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Tout frè yo salye nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:16">Wo 16:16</ref></char></note>Salye youn lòt avèk yon bo ki sen.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Salitasyon de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:22">Wo 16:22</ref></char></note>pwòp men pa m——Paul. <verse eid="1CO 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Si yon moun pa renmen Senyè a, li dwe modi. Maranata (Jésus ap vini). <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:5">Fil 4:5</ref></char></note>Vin non, Senyè nou an! <verse eid="1CO 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:20">Wo 16:20</ref></char></note>Ke gras Senyè a Jésus avèk nou. <verse eid="1CO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Ke lanmou mwen avèk nou tout nan Jésus Kri. Amen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
